# ============================================================================
#  English language pack (en-US)
# ============================================================================
#
#  Same as zh-CN.lang: the file name (minus .lang) is the language code shown
#  in the "Language" dropdown, and every value here is what the UI prints.
#  Format notes live in zh-CN.lang -- read that one first.
#
#  Keys are shared across packs; never rename them, only translate the values.
#  Placeholders (%d / %.1f / %s / %c) must stay, in the same order.
# ============================================================================


