ui.hc.l1 = · 3 minute countdown; %d Gold ransom, %.1f s penalty per closed window
ui.hc.l2 = · Desktop files and folders get randomly locked for %.1f-%.1f s (up to %d at once)
ui.hc.l3 = · Gold is scattered onto fixed drives like C:\ and D:\, and some coins are fake
ui.hc.l4 = · Fake coins are %d%% of the real ones: %d prefix / %d digits / %d both
ui.hc.l5 = · Up to %d popups, and one goes off on your cursor every %.1f-%.1f s
