# ---- second-level notice: normal (mode 0) ----
ui.n.title = Read this first
ui.n.lede = This version messes with your desktop shortcuts:
ui.n.line1 = Desktop shortcuts get tagged “encrypted”, open windows get pulled into the taskbar,
ui.n.line2 = and the wall of popups blocks whatever you are doing. If you run out of time,
ui.n.line3 = your desktop shortcuts go to the Recycle Bin (you can restore them).
